      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281115000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281123266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I need to return something. The VeloBand Pulse.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281129599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. I'm sorry to hear you're not satisfied with the product. Can I ask what the issue is?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281133333332
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just... not what I thought. It's really hard to use and the whole menu system is confusing.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281141866665
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. Did you get a chance to look at the quick-start guide in the box?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281148466665
    },
    {
      "text": "I looked at the user manual online. I just expected more, I guess. It's not for me. I'd like to return it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281153466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, no problem. Let me just check on the return eligibility for that order. When did you receive the band?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281160733331
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know, maybe twelve days ago. Something like that.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281168133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, one moment please... Okay, I've pulled up your file. Yes, I see here that all VeloFit products can be returned within 90 days of delivery. You're well within that window, so I can go ahead and authorize that for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281172133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281187333331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sending a pre-paid return label to the email address we have on file. Just print it out, attach it to the original box, and you can drop it off at any post office. Once we receive it, you'll see a full refund to your original payment method in 3-5 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281188133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I'll get it done.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40312,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767281206066664
